(7010896, 1061934, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d recommend some masking. If your editing is so harsh it makes a baby''s skin have imperfections, you might need to mask or tone things down a bit.</td>', 'I''d recommend some masking. If your editing is so harsh it makes a baby''s skin have imperfections, you might need to mask or tone things down a bit.', '2013-04-01 03:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
