(7011354, 1061415, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - it must be hard to capture something like this. I was watching a little bird (different bird, different continent)doing this around my fuchsias this morning but I would never be able to shoot it - just going outside would make it disappear for half a day. I do have that flower growing in my garden, so that gives me a good sense of scale.</td>', 'Lovely shot - it must be hard to capture something like this. I was watching a little bird (different bird, different continent)doing this around my fuchsias this morning but I would never be able to shoot it - just going outside would make it disappear for half a day. I do have that flower growing in my garden, so that gives me a good sense of scale.', '2013-04-01 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
