(7011404, 1061815, 60495, '<td valign="top">In some ways I like the image and in others I just find it awkward, I keep wondering where her other arm is or if she even has one, also cutting her fingers off hurts the image. I do however like the lighting on the arm and face and the red flower really works nicely with her colorful tattoos. Interesting and awkward at least made me take time to really observe the image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'In some ways I like the image and in others I just find it awkward, I keep wondering where her other arm is or if she even has one, also cutting her fingers off hurts the image. I do however like the lighting on the arm and face and the red flower really works nicely with her colorful tattoos. Interesting and awkward at least made me take time to really observe the image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2013-04-01 21:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
