(7015234, 1061696, 100831, '<td valign="top">ha!!! that is a bit of overkill, isn''t it!! laugh laugh laugh... such a lovely place we live in. Love how you caught the slushy stuff in mid air.</td>', 'ha!!! that is a bit of overkill, isn''t it!! laugh laugh laugh... such a lovely place we live in. Love how you caught the slushy stuff in mid air.', '2013-04-07 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
