(7015955, 1059756, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and the hair really gives this image character. The hair flowing and shaping a tangle of lines always taking you back to the eyes further enhancing that dreamlike feel. Eyes looking away further enhances that feel. Selective saturation on the eyes is very much a personal taste thing but I would have prefered this to be only B&amp;W as with only the eyes blue sort of takes away the realism and the simplicity of the little girl. <br/>Depth is a bit lacking with the lips losing a bit of focus and eyes not as sharp as it can be but still acceptable with some noise visible on the forehead but really not enough to be noticed untill you really check it close.<br/>Well done wit this shot</td>', 'Lovely shot and the hair really gives this image character. The hair flowing and shaping a tangle of lines always taking you back to the eyes further enhancing that dreamlike feel. Eyes looking away further enhances that feel. Selective saturation on the eyes is very much a personal taste thing but I would have prefered this to be only B&W as with only the eyes blue sort of takes away the realism and the simplicity of the little girl. Depth is a bit lacking with the lips losing a bit of focus and eyes not as sharp as it can be but still acceptable with some noise visible on the forehead but really not enough to be noticed untill you really check it close.Well done wit this shot', '2013-04-08 03:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7015958, 1060503, 7889, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking shot. Just wonderful.<br/></td>', 'Breathtaking shot. Just wonderful.', '2013-04-08 03:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7015960, 1061659, 86218, '<td valign="top">Ok... It''s time for me to visist and learn some lighting tricks from you. I am not one to spend much time with all these things but I am curious enough to want to play just a little and experiment. Maybe with time I will grow in to this type of work.. :)<br/>Good strong finish in a FS with portrait. A different pose/comp on this type of work and Im sure there''s ribbons on the way.<br/>PS - I think Im in the mood for Pringles.. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-04-08 02:18:28.</i></td>', 'Ok... It''s time for me to visist and learn some lighting tricks from you. I am not one to spend much time with all these things but I am curious enough to want to play just a little and experiment. Maybe with time I will grow in to this type of work.. :)Good strong finish in a FS with portrait. A different pose/comp on this type of work and Im sure there''s ribbons on the way.PS - I think Im in the mood for Pringles.. ', '2013-04-08 03:17:33.000000', '2013-04-08 03:18:28.000000', 0),
