(7016183, 1060258, 77196, '<td valign="top">What wonderful light and tones! I think the style of hair &amp; dress is unexpected and a bit of a contrast to the well-ordered tile floor and windows. This has all the makings of a true elegance shot, but the Her changes that to a ... a ... (almost want to say tongue-in-cheek, but it isn''t necessarily humorous, and definitely much grittier than that).</td>', 'What wonderful light and tones! I think the style of hair & dress is unexpected and a bit of a contrast to the well-ordered tile floor and windows. This has all the makings of a true elegance shot, but the Her changes that to a ... a ... (almost want to say tongue-in-cheek, but it isn''t necessarily humorous, and definitely much grittier than that).', '2013-04-08 10:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016202, 1060258, 43463, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the light that softly illuminates the surroundings and subject! Morning Mood is what plays in my head when viewing this. I do wish more of the subject''s face was visible - not totally, just a slight tilt of the head to show us a near side profile that she is looking out the window with ....longing or daydreaming. Still it''s a great shot - I was one of your 7''s.</td>', 'Gotta love the light that softly illuminates the surroundings and subject! Morning Mood is what plays in my head when viewing this. I do wish more of the subject''s face was visible - not totally, just a slight tilt of the head to show us a near side profile that she is looking out the window with ....longing or daydreaming. Still it''s a great shot - I was one of your 7''s.', '2013-04-08 10:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
