(7016308, 1060180, 93565, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m amazed you shot this at f16. I feel like even with my 150 macro I get a bit more depth. I try to keep mine a bit lower though, as it sorta starts to break down sharpness wise past f11 or so. Maybe that''s it?</td>', 'Wow, I''m amazed you shot this at f16. I feel like even with my 150 macro I get a bit more depth. I try to keep mine a bit lower though, as it sorta starts to break down sharpness wise past f11 or so. Maybe that''s it?', '2013-04-08 13:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
