(7016398, 1061489, 66952, '<td valign="top">First edit is better than the reedit. It looks more natural, and you lose some detail in the white feathers in the reedit. A beautiful shot, regardless, I can feel him flapping his wings. You got robbed on the score. The only thing I would try to tweak is to attempt (it may not be possible) to get a bit more detail into his black head.</td>', 'First edit is better than the reedit. It looks more natural, and you lose some detail in the white feathers in the reedit. A beautiful shot, regardless, I can feel him flapping his wings. You got robbed on the score. The only thing I would try to tweak is to attempt (it may not be possible) to get a bit more detail into his black head.', '2013-04-08 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 0),
