(7016661, 1061538, 71489, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> nice character study, Romil. Not quite sure about the tight crop on the left, I would leave some space there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Lev! Well I didn''t want to center the composition. Didn''t leave any space on the left so that it seems he''s looking to his right and ''reflecting''.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-04-08 20:11:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: nice character study, Romil. Not quite sure about the tight crop on the left, I would leave some space there.   Thanks Lev! Well I didn''t want to center the composition. Didn''t leave any space on the left so that it seems he''s looking to his right and ''reflecting''.', '2013-04-08 21:11:15.000000', '2013-04-08 21:11:27.000000', 0),
