(7662662, 1059924, 67145, '<td valign="top">you must be very attractive .. or interesting .. the way they are looking at you .. i mean ewe ... !! ..<br/>i''m particularly fond of grain .. altho my tendency is to go for really clear and sharp ..<br/>but what i like about grain is that is seems to give a photo a bit of an edge .. its hard to explain . <br/>but it moves a photo into the realms of art .. just my opinion .. <br/>it took me a little while to appreciate the tones you have used on this pic ... but they gradually grew on me .. <br/>now i''m really liking them .. its like the promise of a beautiful day .. <br/>however .. i vaguely remembered that saying about a shepherd and a delight .. <br/>so of course i googled it .. <br/>"Red sky at night, shepherds'' delight.<br/>Red sky at morning, shepherds take warning." .. <br/>may not be such a great day .. !! .. but your photo makes it so .. :)</td>', 'you must be very attractive .. or interesting .. the way they are looking at you .. i mean ewe ... !! ..i''m particularly fond of grain .. altho my tendency is to go for really clear and sharp ..but what i like about grain is that is seems to give a photo a bit of an edge .. its hard to explain . but it moves a photo into the realms of art .. just my opinion .. it took me a little while to appreciate the tones you have used on this pic ... but they gradually grew on me .. now i''m really liking them .. its like the promise of a beautiful day .. however .. i vaguely remembered that saying about a shepherd and a delight .. so of course i googled it .. "Red sky at night, shepherds'' delight.Red sky at morning, shepherds take warning." .. may not be such a great day .. !! .. but your photo makes it so .. :)', '2020-05-15 18:28:31.000000', NULL, 0);
